/* 启动弹窗。组件样式与 app.wxss 隔离,配色与图标在这里自带一份,
   值取自设计令牌「暖读 / Warm Read」(见 app.wxss 顶部变量块)。 */

.mask {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 900;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 48rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.55);
}

.stack {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  max-height: 100%;
}

/* ---- 卡片模式 ---- */
/* 配色逐像素取自原图 notice.png,不随深色模式改写 —— 用户要求配色也不改 */

.card {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 44rpx 40rpx 40rpx;
  /* 原图是很淡的对角渐变:右上偏淡紫,左下偏淡薄荷 */
  background: linear-gradient(225deg, #EDEEFF 0%, #FFFFFF 45%, #F7FBFA 72%, #E8F9F3 100%);
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 16rpx 48rpx rgba(27, 27, 31, 0.22);
}

.kicker {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #727277;
}

.tick {
  position: relative;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  margin-right: 12rpx;
  background: #3451B2;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
}

.tick::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 10rpx;
  top: 7rpx;
  width: 8rpx;
  height: 14rpx;
  border-right: 3rpx solid #FFFFFF;
  border-bottom: 3rpx solid #FFFFFF;
  transform: rotate(45deg);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.headline {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
  font-size: 46rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  color: #1B1B1F;
}

.headline .em {
  color: #3451B2;
}

.sub {
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #66666C;
  word-break: normal;
  overflow-wrap: break-word;
}

.tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 28rpx;
}

.tag {
  min-height: 52rpx;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 0 12rpx 12rpx 0;
  padding: 0 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

/* ---- 位图模式 ---- */

.pic {
  display: block;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}

/* ---- 关闭按钮放在内容下方,不遮挡内容 ---- */

.close {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  margin-top: 32rpx;
  border: 3rpx solid #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

.close:active {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
}

.ic-x {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  color: currentColor;
}

.ic-x::before,
.ic-x::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  width: 28rpx;
  height: 4rpx;
  background: currentColor;
  border-radius: 2rpx;
}

.ic-x::before {
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
}

.ic-x::after {
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
}

/* 刻意不做深色模式改写:这张卡片是设计图的 1:1 还原,
   配色一旦跟着系统变,就不是原图了。遮罩本身够暗,不至于刺眼。 */

/* 点击反馈:公告图可点跳转时压暗。遮罩不加 —— 点遮罩的反馈就是弹窗关闭本身 */
.pic:active {
  opacity: 0.92;
}
